<!-- G11a-2 fixture, written by hand for the parity harness of PPP (no source music): rolled chords. Bar 1: an arpeggiated RH chord C-E-G on beat 1 and an arpeggiated LH chord C-G-E on beat 3. Bar 2: a rolled chord whose top note is tied into bar 3. Bars 2-3 are repeated. Bar 4 has a rolled chord of two notes in the left hand while the right hand holds. The matcher gives every note of a rolled chord up to 300 ms more time. -->
